      <title>AI人脸买卖乱象：百元到万元，谁在消费你的脸？</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260821/AI%E4%BA%BA%E8%84%B8%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E4%B9%B1%E8%B1%A1%E7%99%BE%E5%85%83%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E8%B0%81%E5%9C%A8%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%84%B8/</link>
